OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after three Jewish
OL,4,Awomen assaulted
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 33-year-old man has been charged
OL,7,Fafter three Jewish women were assaulted
OL,8,Fin Hackney, east London.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Clapton Common at
OL,11,Fabout 13:40 BST on Monday following
OL,12,Freports that a man had been detained by
OL,13,FShomrim, a Jewish neighbourhood watch
OL,14,Fgroup, after assaulting the women.
OL,16,FThe victims suffered minor injuries.
OL,18,FAbdisamad Siad, of Pilgrims Way,
OL,19,FIslington, has been charged with three
OL,20,Fcounts of assault by beating. He is due
OL,21,Fto appear at Highbury Corner
OL,22,FMagistrates' Court later.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
